        {
          "id": "q-god-at-the-center-2",
          "order": 2,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What has been sitting at the center of your life lately? Whether it's fear, disappointment, control, doubt, or sheer exhaustion from doing life at a crazy pace, how has it been shaping your thoughts, emotions, and decisions?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q-god-at-the-center-3",
          "order": 3,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What is one area of your life God is inviting you to surrender instead of control? What would it look like to put His throne above your \"thorn\" this week?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q-god-at-the-center-4",
          "order": 4,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What's one practical way you can recenter your heart on God this week? What specific habit will help keep God at the center? (For example: worship during your commute, praying when anxiety rises, or opening your Bible app before scrolling)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q-god-at-the-center-5",
          "order": 5,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Who might be impacted by the way you worship through this season? Worship declares that God is still worthy, even when life is hard. How might your faithful response encourage someone else to trust God and glorify Him?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
